    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71089" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοτ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>damp, moisture,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοτίαι εἰαριναί</span> spring
				<i>showers,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				8.307
			</span></i> : abs., <i>wet weather,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				551a3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				7.14.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. φυσική</span> natural <i>moisture</i>
			of the body, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				6.24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> a
				<i>meteorite</i> supposed to fall in wet weather, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				37.176
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
